[00:07.261]Moon's up high, shining wide.
{"月亮高悬，洒下清辉。"}
[00:08.979]Counting sheep on my bed.
{"我在床上数着羊。"}
[00:11.435]Who's still awake? Tossing and turning?
{"谁还醒着？辗转反侧？"}
[00:14.372]Little lamb, wool so white.
{"小羊羔，羊毛洁白。"}
[00:16.427]Why're you hiding from the rest?
{"你为何躲着其他羊？"}
[00:18.859]Glow in the dark, come when the sun sets
{"在黑暗中发光，日落时到来"}
[00:22.227]Ayayayaya Ayayayayayaya
[00:26.397]I ring my bell, I ring my bell
{"我摇响铃铛，我摇响铃铛"}
[00:29.587]Meadow grass swaying slow. Gentle green with hints of gold.
{"草地缓缓摇曳。柔绿中带着金黄。"}
[00:33.539]The twilight paints the end of summer
{"暮色描绘夏末"}
[00:36.531]Electric sheep, do you dream,
{"电子羊，你是否梦见，"}
[00:38.659]of machines in your sleep?
{"在睡梦中见到机器？"}
[00:41.067]Or do you dream of running far and free
{"还是梦见自由地奔向远方"}
[00:44.651]Ayayayaya Ayayayayayaya
[00:48.515]I ring my bell, I ring my bell
{"我摇响铃铛，我摇响铃铛"}
[00:51.955]Ayayayaya Ayayayayayaya
[00:55.916]I ring my bell, I ring my bell
{"我摇响铃铛，我摇响铃铛"}
[00:58.860]Oh~DAMIDAMIDAMIO~Sunlight'll tell me where to go
[01:03.203]We laugh and run, all night long
{"我们彻夜欢笑奔跑"}
[01:06.563]DAMIDAMIDAMIO~ River guides the way we roam
[01:10.567]When the night is gone, journey will carry on
{"当夜晚结束，旅程仍将继续"}
[01:14.813]To the secret untold, to the wonder we hold
{"向着未诉说的秘密，向着我们怀揣的奇迹"}
[01:17.916]Running out the woods we know, little sheep we tip tap toe
{"跑出我们熟悉的树林，小羊踮着脚尖"}
[01:21.356]I wandered high and low, now I don't walk alone
{"我四处游荡，如今不再独行"}
[01:25.132]Together on we go
{"我们一起前行"}
[01:28.676]Wuu
[01:32.509]Let's find a way out
{"一起寻找出路吧"}
[01:36.053]Moon's up high, shining wide.
{"明月高悬　清辉遍洒"}
[01:37.644]Set my heart upon a quest
{"让我的心踏上追寻之旅"}
[01:40.070]I'm by myself, but far from lonely
{"我独自一人　却并不孤单"}
[01:43.348]Little lamb, wool so white.
{"小羊羔　羊毛洁白如雪"}
[01:44.997]Why're you running on your own?
{"为何独自奔跑？"}
[01:47.581]I'm just like you, searching for where I belong.
{"我与你一样　在寻找归属之地"}
[01:51.405]Ayayayaya Ayayayayayaya
[01:54.925]Wuu
[01:58.522]Round and around, around we go~
[02:00.177]To the end I'll keep you close
{"直到终点　我都会紧紧守护你"}
[02:02.354]I'll follow you and be your shadow
{"我会跟随你　成为你的影子"}
[02:05.778]Round n round, around we go.
{"转啊转　我们转个不停"}
[02:07.657]Count the stars, then off you go
{"数完星星　你就出发"}
[02:09.745]If I catch you, promise don't hide again~ again~
[02:15.849]I ring my bell, I ring my bell
{"我摇响铃铛　我摇响铃铛"}
[02:21.650]DAMIDAMIDAMIO~ Sing the song we used to know
[02:25.354]We ride the winds, into the wild
{"我们乘风而行　奔向旷野"}
[02:28.828]DAMIDAMIDAMIO~ sing so loud the sky will know
[02:32.649]We laugh we run, until the break of dawn
{"我们欢笑奔跑　直到破晓"}
[02:36.785]To the secret untold, to the wonder we hold
{"向着未诉说的秘密　向着我们怀揣的奇迹"}
[02:40.194]Running out the woods we know, little sheep we tip tap toe
{"跑出熟悉的树林　小羊羔踮脚轻踏"}
[02:43.746]I wandered high and low, now I don't walk alone
{"我曾四处漂泊　如今不再独行"}
[02:47.258]Together on we go
{"我们一起前行"}
[02:51.315]The stars will take me home
{"星辰会带我回家"}
